concept <ref refid="conceptastrea_1_1astro_1_1HasDcmMethod" kindref="compound">astrea::astro::HasDcmMethod</ref> = 
    requires(const Frame_T&amp; frame, const Date&amp; date) { frame.template get_dcm&lt;Frame_T, Frame_U&gt;(date); }    </initializer>
    <briefdescription>
<para>Concept to determine if a frame class has a member function to obtain the Direction Cosine Matrix (DCM) to another frame at a given date. </para>
    </briefdescription>
